abstract: >-
  Operational-formal account of canonical past and future archives in QIK-VRT
  Effect Acknowledgement. A future-indexed effect boundary is proved to be a
  non-eliminable input to present release, while past records remain
  unchanged. Ontic retrocausality and panpsychism are separately classified.
